### Create user

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "adam@gmail.com",
    "password": "123",
    "name": "Adam",
    "admin": false
}

### Test Admin access route

GET http://localhost:3000/auth/messageAdmin

### Disconnect

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signout

### create admin user

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@hotmail.com",
    "password": "123",
    "name": "The Boss",
    "admin": true
}

### Sign in Admin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@hotmail.com",
    "password": "123",
    "name": "The Boss",
    "admin": true
}
### Sign in Regular
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "adam@gmail.com",
    "password": "123",
    "name": "Adam",
    "admin": false
}

### Access admin route
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/messageAdmin

### WhoamI
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/whoAmI
